    <briefdescription>
<para>A property value that is either set explicitly or follows a default. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Backs a QML property with a <computeroutput>RESET</computeroutput> function: <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Internal_1_1ResettableValue_1a00ce876d6c2c5d363b6f533d83c3b8a4" kindref="member">value()</ref></computeroutput> is the value in effect, and each mutator returns whether it changed, so the owner knows when to emit the change signal. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
